---
import { site, categories } from '../data/site';
---

<footer class="site-footer">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="footer-inner">
      <div class="footer-brand">
        <a class="brand" href="/">
          <span class="brand-mark" aria-hidden="true">留</span>
          <span class="brand-text">
            <span class="brand-name">{site.name}</span>
            <span class="brand-en">LIUBAI</span>
          </span>
        </a>
        <p>
          在信息过载的数字世界里，替你筛选真正值得关注的工具与资源。留白不是匮乏，是取舍之后的清晰。
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="footer-col">
        <h4>浏览</h4>
        {
          categories.map((c) => (
            <a href={`/resources/?cat=${c.id}`}>{c.name}</a>
          ))
        }
      </div>
      <div class="footer-col">
        <h4>本站</h4>
        <a href="/resources/">全部资源</a>
        <a href="/collections/">专题合集</a>
        <a href="/about/">关于与收录原则</a>
        <a href={site.github} target="_blank" rel="noopener">GitHub 仓库</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="footer-bottom">
      <span>
        © {site.startYear}–2026 {site.name} · 内容采用 CC BY-SA 4.0 授权
      </span>
      <span class="mono">LIUBAI · POWERED BY ASTRO + CLOUDFLARE PAGES</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
